&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.7pt;padding-right:5.7pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;司法書士小林繁事務所開業(現在)&lt;/p&gt;
